    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Launch yourself to the top and defy gravity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ring Toss is a challenging 2D game where you play as a ring with a single goal: to reach the top. Every throw matters, and every move will either bring you closer to success\u2026 or send you back to the start. With precise physics-based mechanics, you\u2019ll need to calculate angles, adjust your strength, and perfect your skills to navigate a world full of platforms and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with detailed pixel art graphics and a focus on mechanical simplicity, Ring Toss delivers an experience that\u2019s easy to pick up but hard to master. Are you ready for the challenge?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based mechanics</strong>: Throw, bounce, and adjust your trajectory. Mastering the throw is essential to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art graphics</strong>: A vibrant and carefully designed visual style that enhances every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging gameplay</strong>: A design that rewards precision and perseverance. Every mistake is a chance to learn and improve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steady progression</strong>: Levels crafted to gradually increase in difficulty, testing your skill and patience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340760/extras/38be83f9c9935d68830088a484f23a6b.poster.avif?t=1735550214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340760/extras/38be83f9c9935d68830088a484f23a6b.webm?t=1735550214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340760/extras/38be83f9c9935d68830088a484f23a6b.mp4?t=1735550214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340760/extras/58a0b42096adbff21aaf96bd6dd108fc.poster.avif?t=1735550214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340760/extras/58a0b42096adbff21aaf96bd6dd108fc.webm?t=1735550214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340760/extras/58a0b42096adbff21aaf96bd6dd108fc.mp4?t=1735550214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
